      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T11:45:12.000Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/ZfZNsixX2kc/hqdefault.jpg",
      "source": "UC7991AZNku42o3Y36kUZOJA"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx2aui5f4s2b",
      "text": "Just to counter some bizarre comments.\nThe 7,231 at CAP on Friday was Cardiff’s 3rd best home crowd for a Zebre game.\nThe top two came in Zebre’s first seasons of 12/13 and 13/14 before it was obvious they are not competitive.\nCrowds at CAP are on the up and up.",
      "author": "Cardiff Rugby Life",
      "handle": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ouvin3vruox2v2t674dym2c5/bafkreifwhig3c235gkfloyju2rzwylbbjo3sp6xo57fhnk2ib7ywn7i37i",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social/post/3mx2aui5f4s2b",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T11:02:51.303Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "cardiffrugbylife.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwzygnmjbc2b",
      "text": "On Sunday mornings we share our notes from our feature match on Substack, including real-time screengrabs from our WhatsApp group throughout > jeffpagano.substack.com/p/sharks-v-l...",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwzygnmjbc2b",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-04T08:31:57.342Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreifzpg4mayqknnuoplfgt64wqthe3thrwcd4htear6yep3sotqudhm",
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyiydwoyc2w",
      "text": "Second week in a row we pulled a late try out of the bag.  In the end it wasn't the scrums that did for us, could have won that with more accuracy in 22 but again plenty to be happy with, esp Sam's shift.  Thought Sharks might have gotten 2nd half card but still deserved win.  #SHAvLEI",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwyiydwoyc2w",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:22:51.564Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyilu3av2un",
      "text": "Good BP win for the Sharks against Leinster. Champs came back in the third quarter, but the returning Boks made a big impact at the death.\nLeinster head back to Ireland with 3 log points from 2 matches.",
      "author": "Jon Cardinelli",
      "handle": "joncardinelli.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/bafkreicmmiirqk2ft7xymnjwhs66pxlm4ttg4u2v7vqg26qpvuchxm5nri",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/joncardinelli.bsky.social/post/3mwyilu3av2un",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:15:52.284Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "joncardinelli.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyiadnr7k2t",
      "text": "Not convinced \"driven backwards by Jamie Dobie\" is a phrase you'd ever want to hear used about yourself",
      "author": "Scottish Rugby Podcast",
      "handle": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/bafkreifbllydjgwnuwniseg4xdzqgul2n6mvpnva2ybemkowieg7tp4h7u",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotrugbypod.bsky.social/post/3mwyiadnr7k2t",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:09:25.966Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyhzi7xx22w",
      "text": "How many Sharks penalties since the warning? #SHAvLEI",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwyhzi7xx22w",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T18:05:35.874Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwyfico5j22w",
      "text": "3 areas proving the difference here, the scrum, the scrum and oh yeah, the scrum.   Not sure du Toit is 100% legal but it's always about what you get away with and we need a solution quick.  We do look good with the ball but badly needed a lead at the break.  Very much uphill from here. #SHAvLEI",
      "author": "Harpin' On Rugby",
      "handle": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ffaez7heoltx2hhteuxtgxir/bafkreiehjzabtopas56abxv6eloubkkbqofmpztzciypn7d42ne3zbqjae",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/harpinonrugby.bsky.social/post/3mwyfico5j22w",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T17:20:12.139Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "harpinonrugby.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwydxbtl3k2t",
      "text": "Big Staff deciding to back the fact that he was twice the size of the defender instead of giving it to one of the TWO faster guys either side of him butchered a stuck on try there.\nYou never go Full Duhan",
      "author": "Scottish Rugby Podcast",
      "handle": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/bafkreifbllydjgwnuwniseg4xdzqgul2n6mvpnva2ybemkowieg7tp4h7u",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotrugbypod.bsky.social/post/3mwydxbtl3k2t",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T16:52:47.101Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:76m24vhrsckzqfi33uyt6snv/app.bsky.feed.post/3mww4h3dff22f",
      "text": "It's almost time... thank you for your unwavering support! Let's do this together!",
      "author": "Dragons RFC",
      "handle": "dragonsrfc.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:76m24vhrsckzqfi33uyt6snv/bafkreihzvwyirklqwchsdtgblhclnw6rfqviodnvjitltqmj6wyvtix6oi",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/dragonsrfc.bsky.social/post/3mww4h3dff22f",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-02T19:33:07.734Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:76m24vhrsckzqfi33uyt6snv/bafkreia3exvuvzdlyfa4hdvekhr5rlget3o2j4p3ghdcelnvc5i7zyvbky",
      "source": "dragonsrfc.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwvkyhupns2v",
      "text": "\"commencing phase one in early 2029, Balfour Norquoy is pleased to announce a development of luxury 2- and 3-bedroom townhouses\"",
      "author": "Scottish Rugby Podcast",
      "handle": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mqdmx5o74xrnl4jwd7eroh35/bafkreifbllydjgwnuwniseg4xdzqgul2n6mvpnva2ybemkowieg7tp4h7u",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scotrugbypod.bsky.social/post/3mwvkyhupns2v",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-02T14:20:43.961Z",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "source": "scotrugbypod.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwv775qsc2xl",
      "text": "Have wanted to write this piece for awhile about the Boks' record and how some critics and fans have started to lose perspective.\nDespite all they've achieved, Boks always seems to be 1 loss away from being denounced as a boring, old or overrated team.\nwww.dailymaverick.co.za/article/2026...",
      "author": "Jon Cardinelli",
      "handle": "joncardinelli.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/bafkreicmmiirqk2ft7xymnjwhs66pxlm4ttg4u2v7vqg26qpvuchxm5nri",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/joncardinelli.bsky.social/post/3mwv775qsc2xl",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-02T10:49:43.328Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:wizadpqsar4meknsnx7s3rms/bafkreidddzqwjibgmsttihrjpiv6rujdpkflcfpubfokheoc7bpza4qwkm",
      "source": "joncardinelli.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwthzcl5ns2n",
      "text": "New titles this week, obviously.\nSaracens discussion here: youtube.com/watch?v=ZB7G...\nPodcast: pod.link/1837150363/e...",
      "author": "Ben Coles",
      "handle": "bencoles.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreihnbnflj5pmzn2vw5tula7bf7hay7nsutvg5e7suz6y2bnoob5p2a",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bencoles.bsky.social/post/3mwthzcl5ns2n",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-01T18:22:11.253Z",
      "thumbnail": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:kbwtbs2mqfxm4om4l7h7b2r6/bafkreiaamk7svwe6e6do5ybnqxdwcwmuldncyr45s5zisi73crecxebt3q",
      "source": "bencoles.bsky.social"
    },
    {
      "type": "bluesky",
      "id": "bsky:at://did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/app.bsky.feed.post/3mwswdhc57k2o",
      "text": "Leinster team for Saturday announced:\n15. T. Lawlor\n14. T. O'Brien\n13. H. Cooney\n12. R. Henshaw\n11. A. Osborne\n10. C. Gabriel\n9. F. Gunne\n8. J. Ericson\n7. J. van der Flier\n6. R. Baird\n5. A. Spicer\n4. C. O'Tighearnaigh\n3. T. Clarkson\n2. R. Kelleher {C}\n1. A. Porter",
      "author": "The Leinster Playbook",
      "handle": "lplaybook.bsky.social",
      "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:tqaiior3rapjsccnczowb4h2/bafkreigindvb7f6skkn3rjvjebp3pnkmcq2chdzvfyslpzqvymmoex2w5e",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lplaybook.bsky.social/post/3mwswdhc57k2o",
